<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐώδ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄδωδα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweetsmelling, fragrant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν θαλάμῳ εὐώδεϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.382
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.339
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυπάρισσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.64
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				290e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				877b25
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.112
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδυτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				B.
				13.40
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.185
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσώδης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				421b23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐῶδες ὄζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					906b14
				</span></i>
			; of wines, <i>having a bouquet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				120.62
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc.</div>
